      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**ColorFix Patcher: unrelated reference**\n\nLoad any image as the color reference. The model keeps its own composition and takes the reference's palette.\n\n- `tile_mix` lower it, or set it to 0, if the reference's backdrop bleeds onto your subject\n- `blur_radius_px` lower it for stronger color, at the cost of more traces of the reference\n- `start_percent` higher keeps more of the model's own shapes\n\nAdaIN sets the palette of the whole frame, not the color of each object. Name object colors in the prompt if they matter.\n\nTry different seeds: the suggested settings come from tests on one seed.\n\n**Best settings found for FLUX.3 Klein** (one seed, four references)\n\n- Sampler: euler / simple, 30 steps, cfg 3.5\n- Unrelated reference: `adain`, `tile_mix 0.5`, `blur_radius_px 512`, `start_percent 0.15`\n- More object color: `blur_radius_px 256`, with more traces of the reference\n- Tile mode: `blur_radius_px 192`-`256`, `start_percent 0`\n\nThe Klein files are on Hugging Face in a repository that asks you to accept its terms and sign in before downloading."
      ],
      "title": "How to use"
    },
